<p>Two drones struck the U.S. Embassy compound in Riyadh on March 3, sparking a small fire that was brought under control and leaving minor material damage, according to Saudi Arabia’s defence ministry and the embassy. Saudi air defences also intercepted additional incoming drones, as black smoke rose over the Diplomatic Quarter, home to many foreign missions. The attack comes as regional strikes linked to Iran widen, after U.S. and Israeli strikes on Iran over the weekend. Several outlets described continued missile and drone attacks across Gulf states that host U.S. forces. President Donald Trump, speaking to NewsNation, suggested the United States would respond, saying, “You’ll find out soon,” without offering details.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/66bnhdbDtVeFI2tdO6JSS4PgCKnRSbaokw-EeTcdvmL6m9e_UEfU99JaLXcGf9TpxAg1X-rv6rzudH72PBHp2PWVDIWcYRh-EBMQjkwqRSdK4z29W_g-rCPdQ023uKr3dJv5oUVNXIQnuoSWE5rLvpzT3YPharEQfEPeI9IjmnvugMFRyhis3eXbbuyXBMp63kvtqy_bYmcHL5R6E2o7MqU_j-GEUvfgmyz0BVAQrzJkNQe3vlg9NBFZgJ2WDA-OBuN6b5Vn6g' alt='Smoke rises over Riyadh after a reported drone strike near the U.S. embassy complex.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Bahrain interception totals: Bahrain said it intercepted 61 missiles and 34 attack drones, but added that shrapnel and debris still hit buildings and the naval base.</li><li>Verification gap: Reuters said it could not immediately confirm the circumstances of the Riyadh embassy incident, even as Saudi and U.S. officials acknowledged the attack.</li><li>Wider front: DW reported Israel said it struck Hezbollah sites in Lebanon as the broader confrontation continued.</li><li>On-the-ground reports: The Straits Times cited witnesses who said they heard a blast near the embassy complex before smoke appeared over the Diplomatic Quarter.</li></ul><blockquote>You’ll find out soon - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Saudi defence ministry: The ministry said two drones hit the U.S. embassy, causing a limited fire and some material damage, based on an initial assessment. It also said air defences intercepted additional drones. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/us-embassy-riyadh-hit-drones-saudi-defence-ministry-says'>Al-Monitor (Reuters)</a>)</li><li>U.S. government: President Trump indicated the U.S. would retaliate soon, without saying what form a response would take. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-suggests-us-to-retaliate-soon-over-embassy-strike-in-riyadh/article70697803.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Iran (reported): Iran said it struck a U.S. base in Bahrain in parallel with the drone incident in Riyadh, according to Al Jazeera’s reporting. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/3/us-embassy-in-saudi-capital-riyadh-hit-by-drones-fire-reported-ministry'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/drones-hit-us-embassy-in-riyadh-sparking-fire-as-regional-tensions-escalate-13985615.html'>Drones hit US Embassy in Riyadh, sparking fire as regional tensions escalate</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-suggests-us-to-retaliate-soon-over-embassy-strike-in-riyadh/article70697803.ece'>Attack by two drones on U.S. Embassy in Saudi capital sparks ‘limited’ fire; Trump suggests U.S. to retaliate &#x27;soon&#x27;</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/3/us-embassy-in-saudi-capital-riyadh-hit-by-drones-fire-reported-ministry'>US Embassy in Riyadh hit by drones, Iran claims strike on US’s Bahrain base</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-trump-vows-response-after-us-embassy-in-riyadh-hit/live-76191483'>Iran war: Trump vows response after US embassy in Riyadh hit</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/us-embassy-riyadh-hit-drones-saudi-defence-ministry-says'>US embassy in Riyadh hit by drones, Saudi defence ministry says</a> 